cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Akdeniz Tool for HU Calculation"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-07"  
abstract: >-
  Desktop tool for measuring Hounsfield units (HU) in a three-dimensional region
  of interest placed on a spinal CT series. Reports mean HU, median HU, a
  Gaussian-based FWHM interval and FWHM mean HU, and exports a publication figure.
